{
  "id": 135361821,
  "iid": 5895,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Detect HTTP extended CONNECT settings",
  "description": "Extended CONNECT allows the use of WebSockets over HTTP/2 ( RFC 8441) and HTTP/3 (draft in late stages of standardization https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-httpbis-h3-websockets/). Extended CONNECT might also be used by MASQUE and WebTransport protocols.\n\nThese commits are minor tweaks to pick up on the setting value and give it a nice handle.\n\nI also noticed a latent bug in the H3 settings at the same time, so fixed that up too.",
